==> api: setup ... done (T)
==> core: lint ... started
==> core: lint ... done (T)
==> core: setup ... started
==> core: setup ... done (T)
==> core: build ... started
==> core: build ... done (T)
==> api: build ... started
==> api: build ... fail (T)
--- stew: run: echo boom; exit 1
boom
(exit 1)
==> api: image ... blocked by api:build
==> api: test ... blocked by api:build
==> docs: build ... started
==> docs: build ... done (T)
==> web: build ... blocked by api:build
┌─────────┬───────┬──────┬─────────┬─────────┬─────────┬─────────┐
│ project │ setup │ lint │ build   │ image   │ test    │ e2e     │
├─────────┼───────┼──────┼─────────┼─────────┼─────────┼─────────┤
│ api     │ done  │ -    │ fail    │ blocked │ blocked │ -       │
│ core    │ done  │ done │ done    │ -       │ -       │ -       │
│ docs    │ -     │ -    │ done    │ -       │ -       │ -       │
│ web     │ -     │ -    │ blocked │ -       │ -       │ blocked │
└─────────┴───────┴──────┴─────────┴─────────┴─────────┴─────────┘
total: T
logs: .stew/runs/ID
